# Family Roots testing

## Commands (run before commit / deploy)

| Script | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `npm run check` | lint + typecheck + all Vitest + a11y + Firestore rules |
| `npm run check:full` | `check` + Playwright E2E |
| `npm run deploy` | runs `check`, then build, then Firebase deploy |

Always run `npm run check` before committing. Run `npm run check:full` before deploy when tree or routing changed.

## Runner

- **Vitest only** — do not add `node:test` files.
- Tests live beside source: `src/**/*.test.ts`, `tests/rules/`, `tests/e2e/`.
- Slow layout tests use `testTimeout: 60_000` in `vite.config.ts`; keep large-tree perf test under 20s interactive.
- **Playwright** uses port `5180` (not 5173) so E2E does not attach to another Vite app on the default port.

## Fixtures

- Mini graphs: `src/test/fixtures/family.ts` (`person`, `spouse`, `parentChild`, `TEST_FAMILY_ID`).
- Scenario graphs: `src/test/fixtures/*-scenario.ts`, `three-gen-layout-contract.ts`.
- Use fixtures — do not inline 50-line graph setup in every test.

## Coverage by area

### Domain (`src/domain/`)

Test: graph build, validation, commands, audit, collapse, direct-line, connections, date rules.

Edge cases to cover:
- Missing persons, self-relationships, cross-family links
- Duplicate relationships, cycles, disconnected components
- Sibling without parents, overwrite plans, imported/low confidence links

### Layout (`src/features/tree/layout/`)

Test: ELK graph build, invariants S1–S10, structure key, display patches, async layout + worker fallback.

Edge cases:
- Name-only draft changes must **not** change structure key
- Birth year changes **must** change structure key (sibling order)
- Collapsed unions retain union nodes
- Component shelf-packing (no overlap)
- Wide-fan / narrow-cousin bounds in `layout-invariants.test.ts`

### Drafts & display (`person-drafts`, `apply-display-patches`)

Test: merge, commit, discard, parse validation; label overlay without coordinate change.

### Lib (`src/lib/`)

Test: dates (partial formats, life span), person-search, tree helpers.

### Data (`src/data/firestore/`)

Prefer rules tests + command plan unit tests. Repository integration only when emulator setup exists.

### UI

- a11y: `src/components/ui/*.a11y.test.tsx`
- E2E: `tests/e2e/` — tree canvas loads, search toolbar
- Component tests for forms when edit/save logic is non-trivial

## Layout performance regression

`layout-performance.test.ts` guards:
- Large synthetic tree interactive layout &lt; 20s
- Structure key stable on rename

Do not remove these when optimizing — update thresholds with evidence.

## Firestore rules

- `tests/rules/firestore.rules.test.ts` via `npm run test:rules` (needs Java).
- If Java missing locally, rules tests skip with warning; CI/deploy machine should have Java.

## When changing TreeWorkspace / TreePage

- Verify structure fingerprint still skips ELK on cosmetic edits
- Verify worker timeout + main-thread fallback (see `compute-layout-async.test.ts`)
- Add E2E if load or edit flow changes
